[{"title":"题袁氏卧雪堂二首 其一","author":"陶安","text":"洛城风雪未开门，空屋僵眠懒谒人。\n独向岁寒持节操，始知君子不忧贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32804,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题袁氏卧雪堂二首 其二","author":"陶安","text":"雪满横山晓冷严，华堂帐暖蔽重帘。\n纵然邑宰来相见，不似当时举孝廉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32805,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"陶安","text":"鼓罢瑶琴策杖还，空山流水听潺潺。\n夕阳林外风尘起，输与先生不出山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32806,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渊明醉图","author":"陶安","text":"何劳一县恼闲情，五柳柴桑老此生。\n每向黄花作沈湎，寄奴已据石头城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32807,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渡江","author":"陶安","text":"尝闻五马一为龙，烟水迢迢日自东。\n那信江南业儒者，也来中土揽英雄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32808,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"见饥民","author":"陶安","text":"伛偻提携面黑黧，如柴瘦骨强撑支。\n充肠犹欲延躯命，扳上高枝剥树皮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32809,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早行","author":"陶安","text":"月光斜坠树凄迷，山路崎岖信马蹄。\n扑面霜风行十里，村墟渐近始闻鸡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32810,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅夜闻雨","author":"陶安","text":"夜雨巡檐泻瀑声，窗虚灯暗旅魂惊。\n思家非是无归梦，自信离人梦不成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32811,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"途中别友","author":"陶安","text":"岐路霜枫照面红，君归浙右我江东。\n青山今夜看明月，两地相思听断鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32812,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初归","author":"陶安","text":"幽蓟归来鬓若丝，故园三径草离离。\n慰人犹有篱边菊，强吐秋花满旧枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32813,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬晚","author":"陶安","text":"江上风高雪正深，倦游人抱慰时心。\n柴门不扫无来辙，抱膝藜床一畅吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32814,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野花","author":"陶安","text":"点染韶华傅色均，枝枝红白为谁新。\n虽然冷落山林下，也向东风静笑春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32815,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋山曙色图","author":"陶安","text":"树含晓色护林峦，重露如岚滴翠寒。\n猿鸟尽逢山叟惯，未尝惊怪竹皮冠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32816,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为刘博士题画二首 其一","author":"陶安","text":"静趣无穷阅圣经，红尘那到子云亭。\n东风吹动廉纤雨，顿觉郊原草色青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32817,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为刘博士题画二首 其二","author":"陶安","text":"峭壁危峰护紫霞，读书声在邺侯家。\n静凭窗几閒观物，无限春光在杏花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32818,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画二首 其一","author":"陶安","text":"隔岸群峰带鹤汀，水添夜雨芷蒲青。\n展书每向船头读，风外沙鸥亦惯听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32819,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画二首 其二","author":"陶安","text":"山鸟山花别有春，薜萝补屋净无尘。\n箪瓢自得贫中乐，肯逐京华旅食人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32820,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹松二首 其一","author":"陶安","text":"两岸湘云郁未开，一江湘水绿于苔。\n虽然帝子鸾舆远，吹彻璚箫凤亦来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32821,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹松二首 其二","author":"陶安","text":"攫拿百尺耸奇材，鳞满霜皮蚀古苔。\n只恐春雷旧头角，清阴不复护书台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32822,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雁鹊二图 其一","author":"陶安","text":"远塞来宾伴不孤，半生粒食寄江湖。\n虽然矰缴频年少，未可巡更少雁奴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32823,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雁鹊二图 其二","author":"陶安","text":"仙信遥传入綵楼，桥成天女渡河流。\n不缘报喜人争听，金印尝将拜列侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32824,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀友","author":"陶安","text":"别来消息久无闻，目断江东只见云。\n遥想蘋洲吟咏处，此身岂外白鸥群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32825,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送何令归江右","author":"陶安","text":"故山猿鹤正相招，非是渊明懒折腰。\n想见章江门外柳，待君归系木兰桡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32826,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘生省亲三首 其一","author":"陶安","text":"江郭橙香蟹正肥，乍寒游子已成衣。\n经书满架堪探讨，底事秋风苦忆归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32827,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘生省亲三首 其二","author":"陶安","text":"白白晴云望里飞，寸心日夜念庭闱。\n到家喜庆承颜处，春酒盈卮五色衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":32828,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2